<!-- Speed Dial-->
|-|Speed Dial=
=== Overview ===
'''{{Aqua|Speed Dial}}''' is a feature that allows the player to instantly call any NPC upon left-clicking their '''Abiphone''', skipping the process of selecting the [[NPC]] in the menu. It is only available on '''Abiphone Flip+''' models.

To put an [[NPC]] on Speed Dial, the player must right-click the contact and set their contact to Speed Dial. Only one [[NPC]] can be set to Speed Dial. The following interface uses {{NPCSprite|Rusty}} and {{NPCSprite|Maddox the Slayer}} as examples.

{{:Abiphones/UI/Speed Dial}}
